This repository contains code and documentation only.  It contains no model weights, no
dataset files and nothing derived from them (captures, camera frames, images, screenshots,
logs or results).

walk/ follows the inference notebook and package of NVlabs/alpamayo2
(https://github.com/NVlabs/alpamayo2; Apache-2.0; Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION &
AFFILIATES) and reproduces the model construction steps of Hugging Face transformers'
from_pretrained (https://github.com/huggingface/transformers; Apache-2.0).  It imports the
alpamayo2_super package at run time; no source file of that package is included here.

Material you download yourself stays under its own terms:
